  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'm not fussy about accepting friend requests. A side-effect of this is that I can't remember where or when I met many of my VRChat friends. It doesn't help that I'm also bad at remembering names/nicknames. \nI think that being able to see some contextual info about friends might help jog my memory on occassion. I'd like to be able to see the following data and statistics about each of my VRChat friends:\nRe: Start of friendship:\n- Date/time that we become friends\n- Name of world where we become friends\nRe: Last interaction:\n- Date/time we were last together\n- Name of world where we were last together\nOther statistics:\n- Total amount of time spent together in the same world\nPerhaps this data could initially be exposed on the VRChat website with a view to integrating it into the in-game GUI eventually. Where I've said \"name of world\" in my list, that could also be the thumbnail image plus the name plus a link to the world if we want to be fancy.",
